Create a complete single-file HTML game called:

🏆 Healthy Plate Race - تحدي الطبق الصحي

Target Age:
Children and adolescents aged 6-18 years.

Language:
Arabic (RTL).

Technical Requirements:
- One self-contained HTML file.
- Include all CSS and JavaScript inside the same file.
- No external libraries.
- Mobile-friendly.
- Responsive design.
- Works directly on GitHub Pages.

GAME STORY

The player is preparing a healthy meal for a race champion.

The healthier and more balanced the plate is, the faster the character runs at the end.

