- Drag and drop foods into the plate.
- Real-time scoring system.
- Healthy foods add points.
- Unhealthy foods remove points.
- Bonus for creating a balanced plate.

Balanced plate includes:
- Vegetables
- Fruits
- Protein
- Healthy drink
- Healthy carbs

